{"results":[{"url":"https://www.reddit.com/r/kurosanji/comments/1eidocl/what_does_ndf_mean/","final_url":"https://www.reddit.com/r/kurosanji/comments/1eidocl/what_does_ndf_mean/?solution=c49fc494654f6d89c49fc494654f6d89&js_challenge=1&jsc_token=2824be10929bdc604753c70a67a1c3312284c957d348130c770f2561067ce250&jsc_orig_r=","title":"What does NDF mean? : r/kurosanji","description":null,"language":"en","text":"r/kurosanji\n 2y ago \n\nu/MelodyTheWolfQueen\n\n# What does NDF mean?\n\nOther\n\nI keep seeing the acronym “NDF” everywhere in this sub, but when I looked it up I got a definition that doesn’t fit what we’re talking about here in r/kurosanji (something about financials?) And it also seems that NDF is a specific organization. So I was wondering what the acronym means here.\n\nArchived post. New comments cannot be posted and votes cannot be cast.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\nRoblox\n•\n\nAd\n\nPrecise aim and fast reactions decide the winner in Roblox's intense FPS experiences.\n\nPlay Now\n\nroblox.com\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBest\n\nOpen comment sort options\n\n# Comments Section\n\n\n\n\n\nwhiskey\\_jeebus\n\n\n 2y ago\n\nNiji Defense Force. Basically people sticking up for Niji no matter what happens to the talents.\n\nMelodyTheWolfQueen\n\n\n\n 2y ago\n\nOoooooh that makes a lot of sense. It’s also pretty clever, good on whoever came up with that.\n\nwhiskey\\_jeebus\n\n\n 2y ago\n\nYou'll see some people use it interchangeably with Nijisisters.\n\n\n\n\n\nAhegaoPriest\n\n\n 2y ago\n\nCan someone think of our Nijisanji? /s\n\n\n\n\n\nTokoyami01\n\n\n 2y ago\n\nWe're clearly talking about non-deliverable forward\n\nA cash-settled, and usually short-term, forward contract. The notional amount is never exchanged, hence the name \"non-deliverable.\" Two parties agree to take opposite sides of a transaction for a set amount of money—at a contracted rate, in the case of a currency NDF.\n\n\n\n\n\njacket103\n\n\n 2y ago\n\nNijisanji Down Fall /j\n\nkenku\\_aviarist\n\n\n 2y ago\n\nNiDiFister","author":null,"published_date":"2024-08-02T15:57:13.588Z","latency_ms":12084.300615999382,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}